## Business Impact (Modeled Insight)

The annual dashboard revealed that the top 3 states (Maharashtra, Karnataka, Uttar Pradesh) contributed ~35% of total sales, enabling focused regional growth strategies.

Women customers (aged 30-49) were responsible for ~65% of purchases, suggesting marketing efforts targeted at this segment could boost sales by ~10-12%.

The dominant channels (Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra) accounted for ~80% of total orders, highlighting the opportunity to optimize spends and inventory for these platforms.

The Excel-based dashboard and slicer layout are projected to reduce report preparation time by ~30-40%, enabling faster insight-to-action by stakeholders.

(All figures represent modeled insights based on project data.)
